/target
*.pdb

# Built artifact. Never committed: distributed binaries come from CI (today the per-commit
# build artifact; a release workflow may come later). A committed binary cannot be kept
# honest (a running MCP server locks it, CI cannot tell a stale one from a current one
# because the version is pinned, and an unremapped build embeds the builder's home
# directory). build.ps1 stages here after a local build.
/dist
